[{"type":"message","user":"U01TQP86UM6","text":"\u003c@U01TQP86UM6\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1624435936.218900","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"type":"message","user":"U01PMN2BVJQ","text":"\u003c@U01PMN2BVJQ\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1624435612.218600","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"f849d99f-c44d-4e45-9cc8-f8cd751a78e2","type":"message","user":"U025UTETFDJ","text":"感謝です！","ts":"1624426152.218400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OBV4l"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0a758042-07d7-4457-ad3e-a43213f2c4f7","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"これでやるしかなさそうな気がする","ts":"1624415721.218100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QsT"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\nstridx({haystack}, {needle} [, {start}])                *stridx()*\n                結果は数値で、{haystack}の中で文字列{needle}が最初に現れる位置\n                のバイトインデックスを表す。{start}を指定すると、インデックス\n                {start}の位置から検索を開始する。\n                2番目のマッチを探すには次のようにする:  \n                        :let colon1 = stridx(line, \":\")\n                        :let colon2 = stridx(line, \":\", colon1 + 1)\n                検索は大文字・小文字を区別する。\n                検索パターンについては|match()|を使う。\n                {haystack}の中に{needle}がないときは-1を返す。\n                |strridx()|も参照。\n                例:  \n                  :echo stridx(\"An Example\", \"Example\")      3\n                  :echo stridx(\"Starting point\", \"Start\")    0\n                  :echo stridx(\"Starting point\", \"start\")   -1\n```","ts":"1624415664.218000","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"76cce14f-8105-4e85-84dd-a727ca9fa0e8","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":":h stridx()","ts":"1624415664.217900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+b4lf"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\nindex({object}, {expr} [, {start} [, {ic}]])                    *index()*\n                {object}が |List| の場合は、{expr}に等しい要素の最小のインデッ\n                クスを返す。自動的な変換は行われないので、文字列の \"4\" は数値\n                の 4 とは異なると判定される。そして数値の 4 は浮動小数点数の\n                4.0 とも異なる。'ignorecase' はここでは適用されず、常に大文字・\n                小文字は区別される。\n \n                {object}が |Blob| の場合は、{expr}に等しいバイト値の最小のイン\n                デックスを返す。\n \n                {start}が指定された場合はインデックス{start}から要素の検索を始\n                める(負数を指定すると末尾からの相対位置となる)。\n                {ic}に|TRUE|が指定された場合、大文字・小文字は区別されない。\n                そうでない場合は区別される。\n                {object}の中に{expr}が見つからない場合は-1を返す。\n                例:  \n                        :let idx = index(words, \"the\")\n                        :if index(numbers, 123) \u0026gt;= 0\n \n                |method| としても使用できる:  \n                        GetObject()-\u0026gt;index(what)\n```","ts":"1624415660.217800","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"818161d4-8b2a-4fe1-9245-4688dfa40371","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":":h index()","ts":"1624415659.217700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qDFhs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5daa6f58-9505-454a-b8bd-bafa109497af","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"リストか文字列かで処理を変える必要はありそうです","ts":"1624414134.217500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"vim-jp","count":1,"users":["U025UTETFDJ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sd1y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"61137c41-4d77-42c0-8251-2983dec8bed9","type":"message","user":"U025UTETFDJ","text":"（スレチな気がしてきた）","ts":"1624413625.216900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":